---
description: Use Context7 for current external library documentation
alwaysApply: true
---

When a task involves external packages, framework APIs, setup/configuration steps, or code examples for third-party libraries, use the `context7` MCP server to fetch current documentation before answering or editing code.

Prefer explicit Context7 library IDs when they are known, such as `/vercel/next.js` or `/supabase/supabase`. Do not rely only on model training data for library-specific APIs.
